Mathematical Preliminaries and Notation

This appendix collects all foundational definitions, notations, and conventions used throughout Chapter 1 and the associated proofs. It is intended to be a self‑contained reference for readers unfamiliar with the formalisms, and to make the proofs in Appendix C fully rigorous.

